    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that submits an audio file for batch transcription using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Transcribe service, which is a popular choice for batch transcription tasks. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Transcribe client to submit the transcription job. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the use of the Amazon Transcribe client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789849384614,
          "start": 1789849382290
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb562d92001aT8bfLAsxSS0XB",
      "message_id": "msg_0bb55f95900193utOgH6f4JMBb",
      "session_id": "ses_f44aa073affe1Blx17MncYPCq3",
